title: "rowii-monitor"
abstract: >-
  Acoustic and vibration condition-monitoring implementation for the
  Rodundwerk II pump-turbine, developed as part of an HSG master thesis on
  self-supervised transfer learning for acoustic anomaly detection in
  pumped-storage hydropower plants.
